// RichText 的具名分组视觉由 UIX 唯一拥有；Rust 内核负责 Markdown 解析、Unicode 布局、资源、选择、命中与绘制执行。
<Visual
  name="RICH_TEXT_DEFAULTS_VISUAL"
  type="RichTextDefaultsVisual"
  fontSize={14.0}
  unconstrainedWidth={400.0}
  relayoutEpsilon={0.5}
  measurementDpi={96.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="RICH_TEXT_METRICS_VISUAL"
  type="RichTextMetricsVisual"
  lineHeightFactor={1.5}
  codeFontScale={0.9}
  codeBaselineOffset={2.0}
  italicShear={0.18}
  boldOffset={0.6}
  spaceAdvance={0.35}
  tabAdvance={2.0}
  wideAdvance={0.7}
  narrowAdvance={0.3}
  cjkAdvance={1.0}
  cjkPunctuationAdvance={0.9}
  defaultAdvance={0.55}
/>

<Visual
  name="RICH_TEXT_DECORATION_VISUAL"
  type="RichTextDecorationVisual"
  backgroundPadding={2.0}
  backgroundRadius={3.0}
  selectionAlpha={64}
  linkPressedAlpha={48}
  linkActiveAlpha={24}
  inactiveDecorationAlpha={180}
  underlineRatio={0.95}
  strikethroughRatio={0.52}
  stroke={1.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="RICH_TEXT_COPY_VISUAL"
  type="RichTextCopyVisual"
  trailingGap={4.0}
  width={24.0}
  height={16.0}
  radius={3.0}
  iconSize={10.0}
  iconHeightRatio={0.65}
  icon="copy"
/>

<Visual
  name="RICH_TEXT_BREAK_VISUAL"
  type="RichTextBreakVisual"
  horizontalInset={12.0}
  stroke={1.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="RICH_TEXT_IMAGE_VISUAL"
  type="RichTextImageVisual"
  borderStroke={1.0}
  minAltWidth={24.0}
  minAltHeight={16.0}
  altFontSize={12.0}
  altHeightRatio={0.6}
  maxDeviceExtent={4096.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="RICH_TEXT_PALETTE_VISUAL"
  type="RichTextPaletteVisual"
  themeText={rich_text_text_color()}
  codeText={rich_text_text_color()}
  codeBackground={rich_text_fill_secondary_color()}
  link={rich_text_link_color()}
  primary={rich_text_primary_color()}
  fillSecondary={rich_text_fill_secondary_color()}
  fillTertiary={rich_text_fill_tertiary_color()}
  textSecondary={rich_text_secondary_text_color()}
  textQuaternary={rich_text_quaternary_text_color()}
  borderSecondary={rich_text_secondary_border_color()}
  estimatedCodeBackgroundAlpha={24}
/>

<Visual
  name="RICH_TEXT_VISUAL"
  type="RichTextVisual"
  defaults={RICH_TEXT_DEFAULTS_VISUAL}
  metrics={RICH_TEXT_METRICS_VISUAL}
  decoration={RICH_TEXT_DECORATION_VISUAL}
  copy={RICH_TEXT_COPY_VISUAL}
  thematicBreak={RICH_TEXT_BREAK_VISUAL}
  image={RICH_TEXT_IMAGE_VISUAL}
  palette={RICH_TEXT_PALETTE_VISUAL}
/>

<KernelView value={build_rich_text_view(kernel, RICH_TEXT_VISUAL_REF)} />
